cburnett chess pieces
=====================

These 12 SVG files (wk, wq, wr, wb, wn, wp, bk, bq, br, bb, bn, bp) are the
"cburnett" chess piece set, the default piece set of the lichess.org board.

  Author:  Colin M.L. Burnett
           https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:Cburnett
  Source:  https://github.com/lichess-org/lila
           directory: public/piece/cburnett/
  Licence: GPLv2+  (GNU General Public License, version 2 or later)

Attribution as recorded upstream
--------------------------------
The upstream repository states, in its COPYING.md:

    public/piece/cburnett | Colin M.L. Burnett | GPLv2+

This mirrors the licence listed for the cburnett set on Wikimedia Commons,
where the original piece images are released under GPLv2+.

Licence text
------------
The full text of the GNU General Public License version 2 is available at:

    https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.txt

GPLv2+ means the licence text above, with the option to use any later version
of the GNU GPL. Redistribution of these files (or of rasterised derivative
works such as the PNG sprites this project generates from them) must keep this
attribution intact and pass on the same licence.

Notes for this project
----------------------
The files here are byte-for-byte copies of the upstream SVGs, except that the
file names have been lower-cased (wK.svg -> wk.svg). No artwork was modified.

The PNG sprites under devices/*/source/*/src/common/pieces/ are rasterised
derivatives of these files, produced by tools/build_piece_png.py. Being
derivative works, they carry the same GPLv2+ licence.
